OL,3,GNEWSAHuman tutors beat AI at difficult
OL,4,Amaths teaching
OL,5,
OL,6,FA human teacher was found to be better
OL,7,Fat helping students tackle difficult
OL,8,Fmaths questions than an artificial
OL,9,Fintelligence (AI) tutor, according to
OL,10,Fresearch.
OL,12,FResearchers from the University of
OL,13,FCambridge studied how 149 sixth form
OL,14,Fstudents handled maths problems when
OL,15,Fsupported by a human teacher, an AI
OL,16,Fchatbot or an internet search engine.
OL,18,FWhile the chatbot pushed them to put in
OL,19,Fmore effort, they were less stressed
OL,20,Fand solved more questions with a
OL,21,Fclassroom-based teacher.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
