OL,3,GNEWSAHuman tutors beat AI at difficult
OL,4,Amaths teaching
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We need to start judging AI based on
OL,7,Fhow far it supports the whole learning
OL,8,Fprocess, not just where students end
OL,9,Fup," said Megan Ennion, who led the
OL,10,Fstudy.
